{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1efcc25e3fafbc79","name":"Street Chase","source":{"id":"source:reference-1efcc25e3fafbc79","title":"Street Chase","revision":21260,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:27:12Z","sha256":"2d5d14a12595bae03ac6ab8a8af814ff4572cbe3ae50a180735579d2ea26aa5a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21260","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Street%20Chase&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1efcc25e3fafbc79","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},", the players must pursue a pair of ",{"tag":"a","children":["CSA Assassins"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/CSA_Assassins"}," through the gloomy streets of Locus in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Landspeeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Landspeeder"}," chase. During the chase, the heroes travel through different parts of the city's Neutral Zone, attempting to force their enemies to a halt so that they can be confronted. As the heroes accrue Failures, the assassins slip further away, potentially shaking pursuit altogether.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Street Chase Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Complexity:"]}," 2 (8 Successes before 3 Failures)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested Primary Skills for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Galactic Lore)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)"}," (DC 28 or DC 23):"]}," The heroes can try to remember what they have heard about Locus to find shortcuts and secret routes. This DC is reduced to 23 for heroes who are familiar with the city."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," (DC 25):"]}," The heroes can use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," to find the best path to keep pace with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["CSA Assassins"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/CSA_Assassins"},", or to notice any indicators of where the assassins are headed next"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Opposed DC Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Opposed_DC_Challenge","referenceId":"reference:a45d2286e387f4dd"},"):"]}," The heroes can sneak along alternative routes, cutting the assassins off if they remain unnoticed. This check is opposed by the assassins' ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks (+9). The heroes receive a +2 bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks due to the gloomy nature of the city."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," (DC 18 or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Opposed DC Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Opposed_DC_Challenge","referenceId":"reference:a45d2286e387f4dd"},"):"]}," The heroes can pilot their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Landspeeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Landspeeder"}," along the fastest route, avoid debris and obstacles, and find other ways to close the gap with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["CSA Assassins"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/CSA_Assassins"},". If the heroes get close to the assassins, the driving assassin can make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," checks (+10) to set the DC for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"},"."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Challenge Effects"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Challenge Effects"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Challenge_Effects"}," for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Containment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Containment","referenceId":"reference:8011803c077c7457"},":"]}," The heroes accrue Failures only in rounds when no one earns a Success, since they need only keep the target in sight of one person to maintain the chase."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Opposed DC Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Opposed_DC_Challenge","referenceId":"reference:a45d2286e387f4dd"},":"]}," Certain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," in this challenge can be opposed by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["CSA Assassins"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/CSA_Assassins"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted_Skills","referenceId":"reference:d30cd9eef2a424bd"},":"]}," Certain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," are not applicable in this challenge: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swim","referenceId":"reference:dd4fa375c70c4e42"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"},"."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Success and Failure"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Success:"]}," The heroes manage to force the assassins into a location where they can no longer escape by piloting their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder"},". The ",{"tag":"a","children":["CSA Assassins"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/CSA_Assassins"}," must leave their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," behind and either fight the heroes or flee on foot.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Failure:"]}," The ",{"tag":"a","children":["CSA Assassins"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/CSA_Assassins"}," manage to give the heroes the slip, disappearing into the darkened streets of Locus.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
